From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 02:54:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] erofs: consume signed referrer materializations

Add the semantic signed-artifact schema, bounded validation and selection, retained content graphs, precomputed EROFS and Merkle materialization, snapshot binding and cleanup, cached deferred unpack, transfer capability negotiation, fail-closed reuse, and the distinct default-off enable_dmverity_referrers behavior while preserving upstream enable_dmverity and overlayfs isolation.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

Copilot-Session: 925784b1-44a7-4d56-b04f-e527d2e0879f
